{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"librarian-title","type":"text","x":20,"y":-200,"width":2900,"height":220,"text":"# Geo-Grapher graph building across folder review and Librarian enrichment (as-is)\n**Symptom:** 30 graphs use 77.2 GB (up to 19.5 GB for a docs graph, 96 paper-DB copies = 873 MB for a 16 MB DB), 48 published NFL papers lack Source notes, 12 unread RL papers have 0 claims, 72 NFL papers have 0 concepts, 0 bridges exist, and TypeScript AST parsing fails silently.\n**Root cause:** Graph building is split across two disconnected serial CLI subprocesses with whole-store copy/rebuild amplification, no enrichment feedback loop, and no end-to-end verification or hand-off (mirroring OP1 and OP2).\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `geographer-graph-building.spec.yaml`."},
		{"id":"librarian-s","type":"text","x":40,"y":140,"width":360,"height":70,"text":"● start","color":"4"},
		{"id":"librarian-a1","type":"text","x":40,"y":350,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**1.** accepts folder decisions (person UI or agent policy) to trigger graph build"},
		{"id":"librarian-a2","type":"text","x":460,"y":560,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**2.** re-surveys all accepted non-excluded roots (person accept) and writes read-only barriers"},
		{"id":"librarian-d1","type":"text","x":460,"y":770,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ all accepted library roots current?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a3","type":"text","x":460,"y":980,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**3.** spawns apply-folder-review CLI (14,400 s timeout) with all library groups and withheld paths"},
		{"id":"librarian-x1","type":"text","x":40,"y":770,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"re-surveys unrelated stale root and re-applies decisions (OP2)"},
		{"id":"librarian-a4","type":"text","x":1300,"y":1190,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**4.** checks single authorship/stratum per label, child excludes, and >= 5 GiB free disk"},
		{"id":"librarian-d2","type":"text","x":1300,"y":1400,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ strata, store ownership, and disk valid?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a5","type":"text","x":1300,"y":1610,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**5.** loops serially over every reviewed group (OP2); calls ingest(stage=3) without previous_snapshot_id"},
		{"id":"librarian-e2","type":"text","x":2560,"y":1400,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ folder build aborted (opaque GEOGRAPHER_CALL_FAILED); earlier loop groups may be committed\n*outcome: failure*","color":"1"},
		{"id":"librarian-d3","type":"text","x":1300,"y":1820,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ exact snapshot digest already complete?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-d4","type":"text","x":1300,"y":2030,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ Python AST and tree-sitter parsed cleanly?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a7","type":"text","x":460,"y":2450,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**7.** saves application receipt; code/doc graph building ends before enrichment starts"},
		{"id":"librarian-a6","type":"text","x":1720,"y":2240,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**6.** appends full unpruned snapshot to code.sqlite and upserts catalog.sqlite (no WAL checkpoint)"},
		{"id":"librarian-x4","type":"text","x":1300,"y":2240,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"logs parse_failures_json (missing tree_sitter / UTF-8) and still publishes status='complete'"},
		{"id":"librarian-a8","type":"text","x":40,"y":2660,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**8.** queues/captures sources, approves staged items, and starts process_approved batch"},
		{"id":"librarian-a9","type":"text","x":460,"y":2870,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**9.** runs Stages 1-2 (validate, parse/OCR); writes early pre-read .nodes.json (often catalogue_only)"},
		{"id":"librarian-a10","type":"text","x":880,"y":3080,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**10.** runs Stages 3-8 (read, lenses, data, relate, metadata, review); Geo-Grapher is never consulted"},
		{"id":"librarian-a11","type":"text","x":460,"y":3290,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**11.** runs Stage 9 (publish): checks PDF + full read; rebuilds .nodes.json with claims and terms"},
		{"id":"librarian-d5","type":"text","x":460,"y":3500,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ PDF fully read with full_conversion?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a12","type":"text","x":460,"y":3710,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**12.** checks Geo enabled, deepest accepted folder card, fresh fingerprint, and artifact SHA-256"},
		{"id":"librarian-e3","type":"text","x":2560,"y":3500,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ publish: not_applicable (non-PDF or catalogue_only); source reading stands\n*outcome: reused*","color":"6"},
		{"id":"librarian-e4","type":"text","x":2560,"y":3710,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ publish: partial (unread PDF, Geo off, awaiting folder, or FOLDER_STALE); reading kept\n*outcome: partial*","color":"1"},
		{"id":"librarian-d6","type":"text","x":460,"y":3920,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ Geo enabled, folder current, hash intact?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a13","type":"text","x":460,"y":4130,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**13.** spawns cold-start import-library-paper CLI subprocess for this single PDF"},
		{"id":"librarian-a14","type":"text","x":1300,"y":4340,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**14.** under import_lock, re-checks paths, SHA-256 hashes, graph scope, authorship, and >= 5 GiB disk"},
		{"id":"librarian-d7","type":"text","x":1300,"y":4550,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ scope, provenance, and disk checks pass?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a15","type":"text","x":1720,"y":4760,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**15.** clones full prior paper DB to new papers-native-<uuid>.sqlite, upserts 1 paper, keeps all old copies"},
		{"id":"librarian-e5","type":"text","x":2560,"y":4550,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ paper import failed or CAS-conflicted; hidden as publish: partial or cloned DB orphaned\n*outcome: failure*","color":"1"},
		{"id":"librarian-a16","type":"text","x":1720,"y":4970,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**16.** re-checks SHA-256 and CAS-updates graphs.paper_database in catalog.sqlite (no WAL checkpoint)"},
		{"id":"librarian-d8","type":"text","x":1720,"y":5180,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ CAS matched unchanged graph row?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a17","type":"text","x":460,"y":5390,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**17.** records publish: complete; no claim/concept check, 0 bridges built, Source note not accepted"},
		{"id":"librarian-d9","type":"text","x":2140,"y":5600,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◇ populated, checkpointed, and note accepted?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"librarian-a18","type":"text","x":2140,"y":5810,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"**18.** serves current code and paper graphs on loopback /mcp and UI for research sessions"},
		{"id":"librarian-e6","type":"text","x":2560,"y":5600,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ split-brain: published papers unaccepted (OP1), 0 claims/concepts, or uncheckpointed WAL\n*outcome: failure*","color":"1"},
		{"id":"librarian-e1","type":"text","x":2560,"y":6020,"width":360,"height":150,"text":"◉ code and paper graphs current, populated with claims/concepts, aligned with Source notes\n*outcome: success*","color":"6"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Owner","type":"group","x":20,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Owner"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Librarian-Core","type":"group","x":440,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Librarian Core"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Clerk-Model-Host","type":"group","x":860,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Clerk & Model Host"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Geo-Grapher-CLI","type":"group","x":1280,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Geo-Grapher CLI"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Geo-Grapher-Store","type":"group","x":1700,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Geo-Grapher Store"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Geo-Grapher-Service","type":"group","x":2120,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Geo-Grapher Service"},
		{"id":"librarian-lane-Outcomes","type":"group","x":2540,"y":60,"width":400,"height":6190,"label":"Outcomes"}
	],
